# Hospital Chatbot API Tests

### Health Check
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/health
Accept: application/json

###

### Root Endpoint
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/
Accept: application/json

###

### Test 1: Cardiology Query
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "I have chest pain"
}

###

### Test 2: Pediatrics Query
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "My child has fever since yesterday"
}

###

### Test 3: Radiology Query
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "I need to schedule an MRI scan"
}

###

### Test 4: Pharmacy Query
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Where can I get my prescription filled?"
}

###

### Test 5: Billing Query
